.TH ASCIIORGAN 1
.SH NAME
asciiorgan \- keyboard organ
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/asciiorgan
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I ASCIIOrgan
is a keyboard organ.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Typing keys plays short tones through a Tk keyboard chart.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B printable/other keys
Beep at frequency derived from key code
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/asciiorgan.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
